    "scenesThatPass": [
      "AMELIA: Here you go Ron. Nice cup of tea.\nAMELIA: And one for you Norma, that’s got milk in it.\nNORMA: What?\nAMELIA: THAT’S GOT MILK IN IT.",
      "AMELIA: Be careful. What would you like me to do for Wednesday? I can get their birthday cakes, that’s easy.\nCLAIRE: Meels.... I’ve wanted to tell you. I was hoping Ruby would change her mind...\nCLAIRE: She doesn’t want a joint party with Sam this year. It’s stupid I know, their birthdays are so close.\nAMELIA: Oh...",
      "CLAIRE: What have you been doing?\nAMELIA: Sorry.\nCLAIRE: Day off school hey?",
      "AMELIA: Well I’m not scared.\nSAMUEL AMELIA: You will be when it creeps That’s enough- into your room at night.",
      "CLAIRE: No that’s fine. I’ll call you when they’re ready to be picked up.\nAMELIA: I can stay after and help you clean up.\nCLAIRE: I’ll be fine."
    ]
